    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Get Ready for an Extreme Challenge: Tough, Frustrating, and Ridiculously Addictive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a surreal universe where you become a <strong>hyper-realistic stone</strong>, torn from its original painting. Now you're trapped in a strange and illogical world, and there's only one way to escape: <strong>reach the top</strong>. Easy to understand, nearly impossible to achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8 <strong>Unique Mechanics</strong>: Throw the stone with precision, but be careful... <strong>you can only launch it twice in a row</strong> before waiting for it to recharge. Can you stay calm while gravity and absurd level design conspire against you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Challenging platforms</strong> \u2013 Jump, roll, and slide through bizarre landscapes.<br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Surreal obstacles</strong> \u2013 Face challenges that question logic while managing your own sanity.<br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Guaranteed frustration</strong> \u2013 Experience the pain of falling into the abyss just when you thought you had made it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Are you ready to test your limits?</strong><br>Prepare to fall. And fall again. Because here, <strong>every throw matters, and every mistake is felt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd14 <strong>Warning</strong>: Only recommended for players with nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove that even a simple stone can reach the stars.</strong> \ud83c\udf0c</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Get Ready for an Extreme Challenge: Tough, Frustrating, and Ridiculously Addictive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a surreal universe where you become a <strong>hyper-realistic stone</strong>, torn from its original painting. Now you're trapped in a strange and illogical world, and there's only one way to escape: <strong>reach the top</strong>. Easy to understand, nearly impossible to achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8 <strong>Unique Mechanics</strong>: Throw the stone with precision, but be careful... <strong>you can only launch it twice in a row</strong> before waiting for it to recharge. Can you stay calm while gravity and absurd level design conspire against you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Challenging platforms</strong> \u2013 Jump, roll, and slide through bizarre landscapes.<br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Surreal obstacles</strong> \u2013 Face challenges that question logic while managing your own sanity.<br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Guaranteed frustration</strong> \u2013 Experience the pain of falling into the abyss just when you thought you had made it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Are you ready to test your limits?</strong><br>Prepare to fall. And fall again. Because here, <strong>every throw matters, and every mistake is felt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd14 <strong>Warning</strong>: Only recommended for players with nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove that even a simple stone can reach the stars.</strong> \ud83c\udf0c</p>",
    "short_description": "You are a hyperrealistic rock trapped in a surreal world. You jump, roll\u2026 and fall. Over and over. 99% frustration, 1% satisfaction. Do you have nerves of steel? Find out as you try to escape this absurd chaos. Download now and suffer in style!",
